                                            <textFieldCell key="cell" alignment="center" id="gS7-yW-DcZ">
                                                <font key="font" size="26" name="CourierNewPSMT"/>
                                                <string key="title">Every morning, I will stop you from satisfying your urge to check email/Facebook and force you to do your morning routine instead. You can configure your own routine later but for now, I'll give you a suggested activity: 1 minute of mindful breathing. While you breathe deeply, think of how awesome you'll be if you stick to your morning routine every day.</string>
                                                <color key="textColor" name="labelColor" catalog="System" colorSpace="catalog"/>
                                                <color key="backgroundColor" name="textBackgroundColor" catalog="System" colorSpace="catalog"/>
